<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(EnableSensorSplicer) ,XIC(EnableSensorSplicer) XIO(SensorPresenceRollA) ]LES(ReelRadiusA,MinRadus)[XIC(StartA) XIC(Loc_SplicePreparedB) OTL(StartCounterA) ,OTE(LocMustBeSpliceA) ];]]>
