<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(LocEnableAxManSplice)[XIC(Loc_SplicePreparedA) [XIC(AxAEnabled) ,XIO(Enable) ] ,XIC(Loc_SplicePreparedB) [XIC(AxBEnabled) ,XIO(Enable) ] ]OTL(LocMemManSplice);]]>
