<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ShieldCloserd)XIC(ReadyforSplice)[XIO(MemManSplice) XIC(OkForSplice) ,XIC(MemManSplice) XIO(PBManualSplice) ]ONS(locAux1)[OTL(StartForSplice) ,XIC(Loc_SplicePreparedB) OTU(StartA) ,XIC(Loc_SplicePreparedA) OTU(StartB) ];]]>
