<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MachineRunnung)[LES(ReelRadiusB,MinRadus) XIC(Loc_SplicePreparedA) ,LES(ReelRadiusA,MinRadus) XIC(Loc_SplicePreparedB) ,XIC(ReadyForSplice) ]XIC(ShieldCloserd)XIC(AxCEnabled)OTE(StartC);]]>
